{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Here I am standing, etc.</b> The meaning of ״לְפָנֶיךָ״ (before you) in this place, and ״שָׁם״ (there) refers to the rock — for the whole earth is full of His glory continuously, without change of place such that any place would lack the Indwelling Presence of the One who dwells; rather, there are places where the indwelling of His Shekhinah, may He be blessed, is magnified — either according to the quality of the preparation of the place, such as a consecrated place, or according to those who dwell within it."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:29:10.860853182Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}